md=[
 "# Consumer005 isolated harness design","",
 "DESIGN ONLY. No harness source, bindings, ACK or runtime was created. Consumer005 has a separate complete different-author STATIC source/causal-test peer; all24 methods remain UNRUN.",
 "",
 "Both test classes directly subclass unittest.TestCase:19+5 distinct direct methods, no inherited43. The old runner hardcodes one class. A new runner must select both pinned classes, compare actual fresh loader names and ordered IDs against the AST table, then persist actual collection.",
 "",
 "Old GG5 peer aa73 is STATIC preparation only. It is a factual algorithm dependency, never approval of the new harness/runtime. New full Source005 peer is2553985bytes/38keys; old source-peer12/2MiB reader is incompatible. A different reviewed compact receipt or exact role-only closed parser/cap is required. This design creates neither and widens no cap.",
 "",
 "Old inline subtest events cannot fit: three source-fixed families alone emit780 hypothetical passing events. Even an empty namespace strict underestimate gives276146bytes,14002over262144, omitting21other methods and all envelope/source metadata. This is data arithmetic, not collection, runtime failure or a production defect.",
 "",
 "Proposed route: retain all full events in finite createonce JSONL chunks<=131072bytes, rows<=1024bytes, at most4096rows/32chunks; bounded strict readers verify every line and chunk order/SHA/size/count/fullstream digest. The result stays<=262144 and references the immutable chunk manifest. Ordinary stdout/stderr and transcript caps remain.1024 healthy-row grammar is still pending finite derivation/review; no implementation is authorized.",
 "",
 "Use byte-exact Source005/test/Raw4 copies only. Preload required stdlib before denying unknown/project/thirdparty imports and process/native/network events. Six TemporaryDirectory sites require owned-scratch cleanup traversal; blanket inventory denial would mask positives. Permit only reviewed scratch cleanup and reject outside inventories. No full consumer, operational record, fit or live code executes.",
 "",
 "Refresh every dependent source/profile/child/driver/observer/ROOTPS/protocol pin programmatically. Keep closed20/22/22/14/15 contracts only when their actual new shapes are explicitly reviewed; no old peer-schema union or field coercion. Break PS/late hash cycle with independent external CLI self/late pins as before. Real Python six-digit UTC and PS seven-digit UTC producer-role review stays external and explicit.",
 "",
 "Whole metadata means TWO inventory trees plus FOUR independent runtime files, not allsite or fourtrees. Fresh current742/HEAD/index/config guards are opaque preservation only. One-thread60/300/60/420 and Root450nominal budgets,1GiB RAM/10GiB D, owner ending22:36:15 and held coordination remain. Direct handles/cooperative timers prove no physical deadline, Job, descendant/site closure or hard filesystem sandbox; ROOT retained phase supervision and actual clock checks remain mandatory.",
 "",
 "All actual source preparation/binding/current context/whole/resource/coordination/ACK/late/collection/results/terminal/reconciliation slots remain None. Source-only design requires explicit choices and different harness peer before any implementation/entry. Frozen Consumer005 and earlier GG5 records were not amended.",
 ""]
